  },
  {
   "title": "$S(t)$",
   "text": "$$S(t)=(e^{L}-1)-e^{t}\\int_{0}^{L}(x-t+1)dx=8-e^{t}\\left(\\frac{L^{2}}{2}-t L+L \\right)$$",
